      <solution>
        <paragraph>a. $$(i)61.7244(i)61.7244$$ ft/s, $$(ii)61.0725(ii)61.0725$$ ft/s $$(iii)61.0072(iii)61.0072$$ ft/s $$(iv)61.0007(iv)61.0007$$ ft/s b. At $$44$$ seconds the race car is traveling at a rate/velocity of $$6161$$ ft/s.</paragraph>
      </solution>
